    {
        "name":  "create_image_pro_flash",
        "description":  "Create one Pro Flash pixel-art image with an optional left-box style image.\n\nCustom sizes (Beta) accept width and height from 16 to 256 in multiples of 4 pixels.\nQuery get_pro_flash_capabilities for native presets and provisional cost.\nThe style image accepts {url}, {base64}, or {source_image_id}; prefer URLs\nfor uploaded images. Style art must fit the native canvas without resizing.\nstyle_options selects color_palette, outline, detail and shading independently.\nDefault style uses existing PixelLab art. Returns one image; the provisional\ngeneration charge varies with the canvas. Failed pixel grids use image-to-\npixel-art with fixer on the generated box. Poll get_image(job_id); use\nsource_image_id after completion.",
        "inputSchema":  {
                            "additionalProperties":  false,
                            "properties":  {
                                               "description":  {
                                                                   "maxLength":  2000,
                                                                   "minLength":  1,
                                                                   "type":  "string"
                                                               },
                                               "width":  {
                                                             "default":  64,
                                                             "description":  "Native sizes: 16x16 (experimental), 24x24, 32x32, 32x48, 48x48, 64x64, 96x64, 96x96, 128x128. Custom size (Beta): integer width 16â256 and height 16â256. Both dimensions must be multiples of 4 pixels. Pixel-grid recovery uses image-to-pixel-art with fixer when needed. No native image resizing.",
